DESCRIPTION:Solo Exhibition \nFeatured Artist Donovan Woods is a Neo-Soulism visual artist that blends imagination with lived experiences to craft expressive cultural painting narratives. His work is deeply rooted in the search for an essence\, drawing inspiration from the timeless spirit of the Harlem Renaissance as well as paradoxes found in Neo-Expressionist art.  \nJan. 31- Mar.28\nArtist Reception  Feb 7  4pm-6pm. \nArtmoshere\n3919 Raleigh Rd.\nClayton\, NC 27520
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/artist-exhibition/2026-06-23/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Donovan-Woods-1.png
END:VEVENT
